<title>USA: Misonix says named in Mentor suit.</title>
<headline>Misonix says named in Mentor suit.</headline>
<dateline>FARMINGDALE, N.Y. 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Misonix Inc said Friday it has been added as a defendent in Mentor Corp's recent patent infringement suit against Misonix's exclusive licensee Medical Device Alliance Inc.</p>
<p>Misonix said it learned Friday Mentor's complaint had been amended to add it as an additional named defendant.</p>
<p>Misonix said it agrees with its licensee that the suit filed by Mentor is without merit, and said it is aggressively contesting its claim.</p>
<p>Misonix reported that Mentor filed its suit against Medical Device and its subsidiary LySonix Inc on May 8.</p>
</text>
